    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for engine objects that are immutable once their hash has been pinned (typically once they cross over to the front end). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds a single lazily computed <computeroutput><ref refid="class_engine_object_a86178bff24d1f06ec3eba664501bd839_1a86178bff24d1f06ec3eba664501bd839" kindref="member">mHashValue</ref></computeroutput> that defaults to zero and is filled in by <computeroutput><ref refid="class_engine_object_a5d41cd24b788df6502ef4359593fd046_1a5d41cd24b788df6502ef4359593fd046" kindref="member">computeHashValue()</ref></computeroutput> (pure virtual <mdash/> every subclass supplies its own hashing rule). The non-zero invariant doubles as a &quot;computed yet&quot; flag: <computeroutput><ref refid="class_engine_object_a633723c198b26de8f513e91c4bf3120a_1a633723c198b26de8f513e91c4bf3120a" kindref="member">hash()</ref></computeroutput> returns the cached value, or runs the computation and bumps a zero result to 1 so the flag still distinguishes uncomputed from &quot;genuinely hashed
to 0&quot;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
